       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CHECK-TRANSACTION-LIMIT.

DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.

01 LK-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
01 LK-LIMIT-STATUS PIC X.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
    LK-AMOUNT
    LK-LIMIT-STATUS.

    MOVE "N" TO LK-LIMIT-STATUS

    IF LK-AMOUNT > 50000
        MOVE "N" TO LK-LIMIT-STATUS
    ELSE
        MOVE "Y" TO LK-LIMIT-STATUS
    END-IF

    GOBACK.

END PROGRAM CHECK-TRANSACTION-LIMIT.
